A '''trading post''' was operated in the [[central marketplace]] at [[Ro Station]] on [[Pantora]] shortly after the [[Proclamation of the New Order|rise]] of the [[Galactic Empire]]. The trading post was operated by a [[Gran]] [[Unidentified Gran trader|trader]] who was swindled by [[Clone Force 99]] members [[Hunter]] and [[Echo]] after he refused to buy a [[pyro denton explosive]] from them.<ref name="Cornered" />

